---
// Brand story — the catalogue's About copy (intro, promise, Tall Nest
// backing). Jingo owns its story: this section (#story) is the target of the
// header/footer "Our Story" links.
---

<section id="story" class="jg-section jg-anchor" aria-labelledby="story-h">
  <div class="jg-wrap">
    <div class="panel jg-sticker">
      <div class="copy">
        <p data-reveal class="jg-eyebrow eb-paper">Our story</p>
        <h2 id="story-h" data-reveal-heading class="pull text-balance">
          JINGO began with a question: why should a Rs.&nbsp;5 treat feel like an afterthought?
        </h2>
        <p data-reveal class="body">
          In a market full of sweets children forget the moment they&rsquo;ve
          finished them, we set out to build something different &mdash; a real
          brand at pocket-money prices. One with character, bold flavours, and
          packs kids recognise on the shelf and ask for by name. From tangy
          candies to rich liquid chocolate, JINGO isn&rsquo;t just another sweet
          at the counter. It&rsquo;s the one children remember.
        </p>
        <p data-reveal class="body">
          Every JINGO product delivers three things: flavour crafted for the
          tastes children love most, fun built into every wrapper and pack, and
          value that makes saying yes easy. It&rsquo;s a promise to kids &mdash;
          and to the shopkeepers who keep them coming back.
        </p>
        <p data-reveal class="body">
          JINGO is a brand of Tall Nest Group &mdash; a growing house of brands
          built on deep industry experience, combining seasoned confectionery and
          FMCG veterans with expertise in international trade and modern digital
          marketing.
        </p>
      </div>

      <ul class="chips" aria-label="What Jingo stands for">
        <li class="chip c1">Big flavour</li>
        <li class="chip c2">Small price</li>
        <li class="chip c3">Pure fun</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .panel {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: grid;
    row-gap: clamp(32px, 5vw, 44px);
    padding: clamp(32px, 7vw, 88px);
    background: var(--jg-sun);
    border-radius: var(--jg-radius-lg);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 0 var(--jg-ink);
  }
  /* Big decorative quote mark. */
  .panel::before {
    content: "\201C";
    position: absolute;
    top: -0.18em;
    right: 0.06em;
    font-size: clamp(12rem, 30vw, 22rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--jg-tangerine) 55%, transparent);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  /* Desktop: text column (comfortable measure) | pill stack, centred
     against the text. */
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .panel {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      align-items: center;
      column-gap: clamp(48px, 6vw, 96px);
    }
  }

  .copy {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .eb-paper {
    background: var(--jg-paper);
  }
  .pull {
    margin-top: 24px;
    max-width: 22ch;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4.4vw, 2.9rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.06;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    color: var(--jg-ink);
  }
  /* Body: ~65ch measure, even rhythm between the three paragraphs. */
  .body {
    max-width: 65ch;
    font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 1.6vw, 1.14rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--jg-ink);
  }
  .pull + .body {
    margin-top: 28px;
  }
  .body + .body {
    margin-top: 1.15em;
  }

  /* Pills — "what Jingo stands for": an equal-width stack on one shared
     axis (under the text on mobile, beside it on desktop). */
  .chips {
    position: relative;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    width: max-content;
    justify-items: stretch;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .chips {
      gap: 22px;
    }
  }
  .chip {
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.6vw, 1.75rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 14px 24px;
    border: 2.5px solid var(--jg-ink);
    border-radius: 999px;
    box-shadow: 0 5px 0 var(--jg-ink);
    color: var(--jg-ink);
  }
  .c1 { background: var(--jg-pink); rotate: -3deg; }
  .c2 { background: var(--jg-sky); rotate: 2deg; }
  .c3 { background: var(--jg-lime); rotate: -2deg; }
</style>
